## 3. API 規格

### 3.1 Offer 評估

#### POST /api/evaluate
```json
// Request
{
  "jobTitle": "Frontend Engineer",
  "totalComp": 1500000,
  "baseSalary": 1300000,
  "bonus": 2,
  "equity": 0.05,
  "city": "taipei",
  "experience": "2-5"
}

// Response 200
{
  "score": 75,
  "breakdown": [
    { "label": "市場薪資比", "value": "+10", "good": true },
    { "label": "城市加權", "value": "+5", "good": true },
    { "label": "年資匹配", "value": "0", "good": null }
  ],
  "verdict": "可以談判",
  "label": "good"
}
```

### 3.2 薪資數據

#### GET /api/salary-data
```json
// Response 200
{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Frontend Engineer",
      "min": 600000,
      "max": 1200000,
      "level": "2-5年",
      "city": "taipei",
      "source": "104"
    }
  ],
  "sources": ["104", "LinkedIn", "CakeResume"]
}
```

#### POST /api/contribute
```json
// Request
{
  "title": "Senior Frontend Engineer",
  "salary": 1800000,
  "city": "taipei"
}

// Response 201
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "感謝您的貢獻"
}
```

